# Vandeta ucmitm payload - rickroll with no Wi-Fi password.
#
# No station link is used. An open twin AP with the picked network's name comes
# up, the real AP's clients are deauthenticated onto it, and every request is
# answered with the rickroll page. Nothing here needs a key, so it runs on WPA2
# exactly like on an open network.
#
#   MITM Attack > ucmitm: on > Network > pick the AP > Payload > rickroll.ucmitm
#
# `twin` with no argument keeps the picked network's name. `deauth on` pushes its
# clients off the real AP; turn it off for a quiet twin.

twin
deauth on
page * html/rickroll.html
dns * this
